Assets de terceros incluidos en public/anims/ (todos CC0 1.0 Universal, dominio público):

- human-base-animations.glb, human-addon-animations.glb
  Mesh2Motion (https://github.com/Mesh2Motion/mesh2motion-app) — CC0 1.0
- AnimationLibrary_Godot_Standard.gltf/.bin
  Universal Animation Library de Quaternius (https://quaternius.com) — CC0 1.0
- kaykit_knight.glb
  KayKit Adventurers Character Pack de Kay Lousberg (https://kaylousberg.com) — CC0 1.0

public/models/example.glb y public/anims/meshy_walking.glb / meshy_running.glb fueron
generados con la API de Meshy (https://meshy.ai) por el propietario del repositorio.
